license: MIT
abstract: "A local-first desktop interface for locally managed language models and grounded natural-language exploration of the fixed EWD/CBD/RMD scientific dynamical-model repository suite. Ask the Model v0.3.0 adds repository lifecycle management, deterministic retrieval, per-conversation repository/model pinning, multi-chat navigation and exact on-demand citation provenance while preserving ordinary zero-repository local chat."
keywords:
  - local AI
  - local-first
  - large language models
  - Ollama
  - scientific models
  - dynamical models
  - natural-language interface
  - research software
